# Build context hygiene for docker/Dockerfile.api and docker/Dockerfile.web.
# Anything listed here is NOT sent to the daemon — keep host build artefacts out so the image
# builds are reproducible and do not inherit the host's node_modules / target trees.

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Node / Next
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.pnpm-store

# Java / Maven
**/target

# Local runtime data & secrets
.data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.prod.example

# Test & tooling output
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/.playwright
scratchpad

# Docs / benchmark material that no image needs
docs
pm-tool-benchmark
DEPLOY.md
README.md
index.html
plus_sign.svg
